# Showcase repo, whitelist: only what is listed here is published; new files are excluded by default.
# Public: README + media, setup files, the rigid-cup baseline and the discrete-shell code.
# Private (stays local): discrete_shell/docs (notes), the flex experiments, third_party/ (fetched by
# fetch_panda.sh), and all generated videos, logs and XML.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!media/
!media/*.gif
!media/*.png
!requirements.txt
!fetch_panda.sh
!cube_drop.py
!cup_rigid.py
!cup_rigid_cube.py
!cup_rigid_cube_airdrop.py
!panda_cup_rigid.py
!discrete_shell/
discrete_shell/*
!discrete_shell/*.py
